          "text": "A Natural minor",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " first, the Dorian card lights exactly one amber chip — "
        },
        {
          "text": "F#",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " — and the Phrygian card exactly one — "
        },
        {
          "text": "Bb",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Each card's single amber chip is precisely its characteristic note, because ordering the reference scale first is what makes the tint land there. That's the whole chapter in one block."
        }
      ]
